    "description": "Designing, developing, and maintaining full stack payment processing software for 900+ school districts\nat a national scale.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n· System Design: Taking a project from the product portfolio, designing a system to meet its\nrequirements, and refining the system implementation into well-sized action items. This includes\ncreating UML diagrams to represent the system and iterating on the design with product owners.\n\n· Implementation: Picking up the next issue in the active sprint and resolving it with code.\nResolution includes creating unit, integration, and system tests as well as test harness components\nas appropriate, and seeing the issue along to User Acceptance Testing in a production environment.\n\n· Maintenance: Maintaining current and legacy POS and payment processing systems.\n\n· Teamwork: Regular participation in pair/mob programming alongside group system design; at-\ntending LeadDev Together 2021.\n\n· Organization: Applying Agile/Scrum best practices and iteratively improving techniques while\nparticipating in and leading sprint rituals.\n\n· Documentation: Contributing to the growth of our team’s knowledge base and notekeeping\nmethodology; using Miro for virtual whiteboarding, design, and collaboration.",
